-- 180_bot_only_mediums_for_dlt.sql
-- Register 19 bot-engine-local mediums in dream_mediums as BOT-ONLY rows so
-- "Dream Like This" can resolve them. Previously these existed only in each
-- bot s index.js mediumStyles (no DB row), so resolveMediumFromDb fell back to
-- canvas for recipe-less posts and DLT mis-rendered the look.
--
-- Flags match the existing bot-only pattern (gi_joe_figures / vampire_portrait):
--   is_active=false + is_bot_only=true  → hidden from the app medium picker
--   is_public=true, is_dream_eligible=false
--   character_render_mode: embodied for toys/figures/food, natural for painted/3D characters
--   face_swaps: true for painted-CHARACTER mediums (paint the user s likeness in),
--               false for toys/figures/food/scenes
-- flux_fragment + directive are ported from each bot s mediumStyles.
-- (retrobot "cinematic" intentionally skipped — it has no mediumStyles definition.)
-- ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING so re-running is safe and never clobbers an existing row.

ON CONFLICT (key) DO NOTHING;
